{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "27327becc163ecff2c4d2d857ae74e37ab69dbe5acc67646f78df72777851179", "ja": "（クレシェンドブルーのステージプランも、\nだいぶ固まってきたな）", "zh": "（「Crescendo Blue」的舞台计划\n也差不多定案了呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dea65252c308fdfdfad4d170f7ef1f0c83eea2c40e7f9fd6a12f05899e4329f9", "ja": "（アイドル達の熱意に応えようと、スタッフも日々、\n頑張っている。いい公演にしないとな……）", "zh": "（为了回应偶像们的热情，工作人员也天天努力，\n一定要打造一场精彩的公演才行啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1002_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5e654c8c39b919e14a53dd773ad5c840a77183be211bee2b1afb08951d076054", "ja": "おっと、電話だ。\nはい、765プロライブ劇場です。", "zh": "哦，有电话。\n您好，这里是765艺能演唱会剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "7272cb63d364bcc568f7fd4dc771274c662eccf78b71fed75f89a7a207c45358", "ja": "え？　箱崎さん……あ、星梨花のお父さんですか！？\nいつもお世話になっております！", "zh": "咦？箱崎先生……啊，是星梨花的爸爸吗！？\n平时受您照顾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8ec2b192996896853c67f027762135cbe46202b172c42f259d9c8f11b7fb11c5", "ja": "え？　昨日の星梨花の帰宅時間……？\nあっ……！", "zh": "咦？昨天星梨花回家的时间……？\n啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "f61a63e80115e5174bfad2592ca1fd08a66452be34c749b7a0bb6e6290fed99d", "ja": "そんな！　わたしには何も言わなかったのに、\n{$P$}さんだけ怒るなんて……。", "zh": "怎么这样！明明什么也没跟我说，\n却只对{$P$}先生发怒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5fa8761f843ac788ea92a6c9613bfc89b24ece68bd0e2507f09515b26340b848", "ja": "いや、ちゃんと連絡しなかった俺が悪かったんだ。\n中学生を、外が暗くなるまで帰さないなんて……。", "zh": "不，没有确实联络是我不好，\n竟然让国中生在天黑之后才回家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0e16a0f747af1d0777f70fd2eb756fe80f201b899d92571b470844ebffaa263a", "ja": "確かに非常識だったよ。\nずいぶん心配させてしまったようで、申し訳ない。", "zh": "这的确是没有常识，\n似乎让你的爸爸非常担心，很抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c9b945345af06da150224cc4629e0720e4305009998935728e8c2fd3e43daa33", "ja": "それで、お父さんとも話し合って、\n星梨花には門限を設けることにしたんだ。", "zh": "因此我和你的爸爸谈过，\n决定对星梨花设下门禁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "42810da6be2166c43b3f552683949500dc747ee9cf3a0b43cf5179afef682626", "ja": "門限……。みんながレッスンしてるのに、\nわたし、先に帰らないといけないんですか……？", "zh": "门禁……大家都还在练习的时候，\n我得一个人先回家才行吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b21218970efc604d737ead84d166a1ac4a2fb778c0805888361341aee60f595e", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だ。\nレッスンに必要な時間は、きちんと確保するよ。", "zh": "不用担心，\n我会预留训练课程需要的时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "518de85cb85528fa529205e07f64a06e702685a2e539edd9c65b9508550446a9", "ja": "ステージに支障はないし、みんなにも迷惑を\nかけることにはならないから、安心して欲しい。", "zh": "不会对表演造成影响，也不会为大家带来困扰，\n希望你可以安心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "d879d4abfebd8f9ac9b4c2d44a4b9e0d396de69e80994a13758351725c9448de", "ja": "よかったわね星梨花。レッスンも工夫するから、\n心配しないで、いつも通りやりましょう。", "zh": "太好了，星梨花。练习方面我们也会想办法安排的，\n你就不要担心，照常进行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "d26851586e931d52e336b443848a8931d2ccbd9182b66ef360a9bd026326521a", "ja": "は、はいっ！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好、好的！\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "e9b804c6725a76a990d22367503d4b321ac9534bb00d01c7c24e39dfefef04f5", "ja": "それじゃ、みんなも待ってるだろうし。\nトレーニングルームに行きましょうか？", "zh": "那么，毕竟大家还在等着，\n我们去训练房吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "113914809f737eeb77878991a682431c06373772999769931554d85a0085618a", "ja": "俺もあとで見に行くよ。\n星梨花、静香、本番までもう少しだ、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "我等等也会过去看的。星梨花、静香，\n离正式演出还剩一点时间，好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "4e3f903808f76e4287ab7a334ce073a2e2c9c5b0149124407fd2dd9349394d5a", "ja": "星梨花、タイミングずれてる！\n後半バテたからって、モタつかないで！", "zh": "星梨花，你慢拍了！\n就算后半段跳累了，也不要慢吞吞的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "3d700f16682f0cd2537080da272003c717426acbf7592ec8c9677ab3efacff49", "ja": "お～っとっと！　みんなこっち寄りすぎ～！\n茜ちゃんが好きなのはわかるけど！", "zh": "哎～唷唷！大家靠太近了～！\n虽然知道大家都喜欢小茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "6886525a6da0d2d63d906fb37022a75a6b69e5d39ef595892dc10060cccc314c", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\n振り付けは、なんとか頭に入ったけど……。", "zh": "呼、呼……\n好不容易把舞步记下来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "cc0099e06e335fbc909a48a2264484482d5dc7308afdd4adf6f40048589b2fb9", "ja": "タイミングは、体で覚えなきゃダメみたい。\nもっと歌もダンスも、回数をこなしていかなきゃ。", "zh": "时间点似乎要靠身体记下来才可以，\n唱歌和舞步都得反复练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "a8cc7a01c871034868bcfc7801c44cc134a61dfbdef190987995b2056041c5a4", "ja": "……そうね。もう、それしかないのかも。", "zh": "……是啊，大概只能这么做了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "85d0b1b270df2bc47ff33ec41d8febda8ef68b5cb7942d9b875e1037f729b096", "ja": "そっか～。じゃあ、今日も残って練習する？", "zh": "是喔～那今天也要留下来练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a5962bbb5435dff0e49b13770b9597ca99528049a0f67cea1314ec596ba874b8", "ja": "ああ、そのことなんだけど……。\n居残り練習は、なしにしようと思うんだ。", "zh": "关于这件事……\n我打算取消延长练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "6955385b9fc86cc033f8139bec7a53fef8873cb908acd97642ff6cddaced0eb9", "ja": "そうなんですか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "784013773a3550d71bda52aa59a14c736c79b755d7f037f8129629aa4ecd583f", "ja": "はい、{$P$}と相談して決めました。\n練習は、時間通りに終わらせます。", "zh": "是的，这是和{$P$}\n讨论后决定的，练习会按照预定时间结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "0fa6c21031da60b022e29d207a2b7a3e0fa0d689ff6158050734527b2f8de6a1", "ja": "あれっ、そうなの？　意外……。", "zh": "咦，是吗？真意外……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "b98bc0d519e7123a70f011a27a63ffac50bd08a1d720676ab10c8fc4575e6b81", "ja": "……どうして、そうなるの？\n回数をこなすんじゃなかったの？", "zh": "……为什么会这样？\n不是说要反复练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "3197d455b4590bc1c2045228b731c796ea6ac44b843c1a5b2c196fcd79c7e638", "ja": "そうだけど、それは練習時間の中ですればいいから。\nみんな、この公演以外の用事だってあるし……。", "zh": "是没错，但那在练习时间内进行就可以了，\n毕竟大家除了公演也还有其他事要做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "7aab951c6a622b3345df7287a5a2f67ff9f8ff86f88ef95fab6da0dca962f952", "ja": "他の用事……。", "zh": "其他的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "4a249dce8530b68a1075a84c955565352bb0f0a9208e4d8d7950e50cf3800b17", "ja": "志保？", "zh": "志保？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "fb6c14f982a42c8fd0a2da3dc1d53682ad9080f44ac976749a021d228b274b57", "ja": "何でもないわ。……そう。\nリーダーのあなたが言うなら、仕方がないわね。", "zh": "没什么……这样啊，\n既然担任队长的你这么说，就没办法了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "5668ba5eb8a5b675dbd510737cafd8bc570da6717a5395ced6a8b5d0ebc0f9d1", "ja": "ち、ちがうんです志保さんっ！　あの……っ。", "zh": "不、不是的，志保姊姊！那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "e803ad55a10b72026f6898b744cdde5f0bad4909080baf4e8cf444d00f207d16", "ja": "なに、志保。言いたいことがあるなら、遠慮しないで。", "zh": "什么事，志保？如果有话想说就直说无妨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "5c25534d1b852dab463d5f6deb8ba4a5405ca5b8035044759f9aa4ce2332245f", "ja": "別に、何もないわ。\nそれに、言ったからって、変わらないだろうし。", "zh": "没有什么事，\n而且就算说了也不会有任何改变吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1039_033sih", "source_sha256": "fee170c292875f8baa8f597f000c0e0459981643b09183613b1523eefa95d9df", "ja": "それより、もう時間でしょ。\n私、帰るわ。お疲れさまでした。", "zh": "不谈这个了，时间已经到了吧？\n我回去了，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "baf14c63ffbefe1bbb302fba282b247cece1eeadd33a4cf93594d1b765eadead", "ja": "ちょっと……志保！", "zh": "等等……志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1041_se", "source_sha256": "172a52394be90cca6467e0a57d29eba5541a0b314af596f3855f7d00b40d23ab", "ja": "パタン", "zh": "磅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "a6f29ca15edc60de07b61a157fbf7e52860bb27378f8eefbd96d56c14d82ba00", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、静香。\n志保には、俺から後でちゃんと話しておくから。", "zh": "没事的，静香。\n我之后会找志保好好谈谈的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1043_015siz", "source_sha256": "af60f47cbf3da6f416e881e4cba487f1833d5f7b3ba0850c360a8577f6cecde4", "ja": "{$P$}……\nわかりました。お願いします……。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n我知道了，拜托你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "e053fc09522667d96ad6e03b04abfb8961f3d929fb07cd78c2c9c610bf6ca81e", "ja": "（一筋縄ではいかないな……。\nだけど本番のステージまでは、まだ時間がある）", "zh": "（没办法简单解决呢……\n但距离正式表演还有时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "8b701e25cebb04ff81e3656f5b1915145ebcf00ad926d1b7d859b81d8f7e78b9", "ja": "（目指している場所は、みんな同じなんだ。\n歩幅と道筋だけ、そろえることができれば……）", "zh": "（大家的目标都是相同的。\n要是能让大家的步调和路线一致……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "b0125170e6b1cc0302e055af3523657fe5fc6e02901814dcb9da9ad4a0649302", "ja": "止まらない時間", "zh": "不会停下的时间", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0004_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "130b1defc468a53a54f947c6458a7fb8e82256e01bfbff4cbcee10935cf31d5d", "ja": "公演に向けての居残りレッスンが原因で、\n星梨花は門限を設けられてしまうことに。\nこれを機にプロデューサーは静香と相談し、\n居残りレッスンの中止を決めるが、レッスン\nが捗らないことに志保は不満を覗かせる。", "zh": "为了公演而延长练习时间，\n结果使得星梨花被设下了门禁。\n制作人借这个机会向静香讨论，\n决定停止延长练习，但练习进度落后\n也让志保逐渐展露不满。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
